    "comments": {
      "en": "Normative basis: VDI/VDE 3682 Part 1 and Part 2, issue May 2015.\r\n\r\nTwelve classes and seven relations. Every definition carries the German wording of the standard alongside its English translation, since the standard is issued bilingually.\r\n\r\nScope: Part 1 in full, and from Part 2 the state as a class of the information model. The attribute structure of Part 2 Section 4.4 is not covered."
    },
